{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience a tantalizing teaser of the upcoming four-player party game!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>Maximus Mouse is back!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience manic arcade action set across loads of game modes. Classic arcade gameplay with many twists and surprises awaits you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those pesky cats have stolen Max's retirement fund!  Pursue them around the world to get it back, but watch out for surprises along the way!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Party!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab three of your friends for some couch mayhem!  Stay alive, grab those coins and capture those cheeses! Use power ups to your advantage, but beware - anything can happen: laser attacks, high winds, and lemon hitmen are just a few of the events you'll face.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and do keep an eye out for that walrus!    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pit your wits against the cats across 50+ trials. Quick, bite-sized challenges to test any mouse!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Arcade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try your hand at the arcade modes and beat those scores!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739910?t=1748530636","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739910?t=1748530636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739910/ba48b6cf872cf4f78b7da0a6e23761932356c364/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748530636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739910/ba48b6cf872cf4f78b7da0a6e23761932356c364/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748530636","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience a tantalizing teaser of the upcoming four-player party game!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>Maximus Mouse is back!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience manic arcade action set across loads of game modes. Classic arcade gameplay with many twists and surprises awaits you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those pesky cats have stolen Max's retirement fund!  Pursue them around the world to get it back, but watch out for surprises along the way!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Party!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab three of your friends for some couch mayhem!  Stay alive, grab those coins and capture those cheeses! Use power ups to your advantage, but beware - anything can happen: laser attacks, high winds, and lemon hitmen are just a few of the events you'll face.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and do keep an eye out for that walrus!    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pit your wits against the cats across 50+ trials. Quick, bite-sized challenges to test any mouse!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Arcade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try your hand at the arcade modes and beat those scores!</p>","developers":["Pug Fugly Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3022360","name":"Maximus Mouse's Manic Mayhem"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"he